 "title": "Road Bike by Frank",
 "body_html": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"680938726\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.680938726 c362\">What made you decide to build a bamboo bike?</h4>\n<p class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.680938726 c362\">The idea to build a frame from wood is just amazing. Environment friendly and a natural source are a big point as well.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"845063547\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\">Did you enjoy building the bicycle from scratch and would you recommend the experience?</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Yes I did and I would recommend it to everyone who likes cycling.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"805044919\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c367\"></div>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c367\">What did you find most difficult about your bike build?</h4>\n<p class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c367\">To build the Road Bike easy wasn't difficult at all.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"1370153519\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1370153519\">What was the easiest part of the build?</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">To glue it</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"862135650\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.862135650 c372\">How would you describe the ride of your finished bike?</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Outstanding, amazing and surprising. Went out with a big smile and couldn't believe how good the frame is on the road.</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"1476906189\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf G4EHhc\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1476906189 c375\">What would you improve about the build experience or your finished bike?</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Nothing</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/CArbonbikebuild.jpg?v=1648136697\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
